# FACE → TOP INTERNAL LAW

**Status: MANDATORY · NON-NEGOTIABLE.** Owner locked 2026-07-13.  
**Change only with owner passcode `4444`.**

## The rule

Whenever a **face card** image is set for a Q&A / answer entry, the **top internal** image on the answer page **must be the same URL** — automatically. No separate pull. No Pollinations. Dupes required.

Applies to:

1. **Square Builder** — face click writes face JPG **and** sets top hero/markdown to that same `/assets/qa/{id}.jpg`
2. **Manual pillar face/tops** — face write → top write same URL → next
3. **Any other image write path** that sets `img` / face — also set top internal to match

## Top 10 / Q&A / Style

| Type | Face → top? | Extra skeleton blanks |
|------|-------------|------------------------|
| Q&A essay | **Yes** (auto) | Section image 1 · Section image 2 |
| Style | **Yes** (auto) | Outfit slots |
| Top 10 | **Yes** (auto top hero) | `#1 · name` … `#10 · name` product blanks |

## Square Builder skeleton

Internal answer screen is a **skeleton**, not a live page rebuild:

- Top block already filled / marked done (face)
- Below: named blank grid — click blank → Pexels → click → fills that slot

## Do not

- Leave top internal empty when face exists
- Force a second unique photo for the top slot by default
- Bake the title into the face JPG (title stays OVER the photo in UI/CSS)
